{% extends "_base.txt.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "TREASURY BALANCE CORRECTED" %}
{% set headline = "Admin balance correction recorded" %}
{% block body %}
An administrative balance correction was applied. Per the supply invariant,
every correction is logged immutably to the EventStore and audited against
the issued/circulating ledger.

  Agent DID:     {{ agent_did }}
  Delta:         {{ delta }} {{ frame_currency }}
  New balance:   {{ new_balance }} {{ frame_currency }}
  Reason:        {{ reason }}
  Actor:         {{ actor }}
  Recorded at:   {{ recorded_at }}

Open projections: {{ registry_ui_url }}#/admin/projections

Positive deltas count toward tokens_issued in the supply audit. Negative
deltas record the correction without decrementing the issued total.
{% endblock %}
